</style></div><div class="main-wrapper"><div data-animation="default" data-collapse="medium" data-duration="400" data-easing="ease" data-easing2="ease" role="banner" class="navbar w-nav"><div class="navbar_container"><a href="#" class="navbar_logo-link w-nav-brand"><img src="/assets-f/img/9fbd1fd32ecfd3.webp" loading="eager" alt="" class="navbar_logo"></a><div class="navbar_link-wrapper"><a href="#" class="navbar_link w-nav-link">Home</a><a href="#" class="navbar_link w-nav-link">Satellites</a><a href="#" aria-current="page" class="navbar_link w-nav-link w--current">About</a><a href="#" class="navbar_link w-nav-link">Careers</a></div><div id="gravitas-countdown" class="navbar_time w-node-_7238c7d4-ea14-da80-500b-7fc59ff69cd9-9ff69ccc">T+119d 14h 42m 13s / Gravitas</div><a id="menu" data-w-id="c04c97bb-a4f2-0658-b20d-2a1456e2d429" href="#" class="navbar_hamburguer w-node-c04c97bb-a4f2-0658-b20d-2a1456e2d429-9ff69ccc w-inline-block"><div class="navbar_hamburguer-line-1"></div><div class="navbar_hamburguer-line-2"></div></a></div></div><section class="section_satelites-header"><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="satelites-header_component"><div class="bg-section"><div class="bg-overlay"></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69333244a7b7aea22b21941a/69333244a7b7aea22b2194d8_about-header.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 2285px) 100vw, 2285px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69333244a7b7aea22b21941a/69333244a7b7aea22b2194d8_about-header-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69333244a7b7aea22b21941a/69333244a7b7aea22b2194d8_about-header-p-800.webp 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69333244a7b7aea22b21941a/69333244a7b7aea22b2194d8_about-header-p-1080.webp 1080w, /assets-f/img/9a2ab925fdfb9e.webp 1600w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69333244a7b7aea22b21941a/69333244a7b7aea22b2194d8_about-header-p-2000.webp 2000w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69333244a7b7aea22b21941a/69333244a7b7aea22b2194d8_about-header.webp 2285w" alt="" class="cover-image is-about"></div><div class="satelites-header_grid"><div id="w-node-fb9e1c04-9ec6-abfa-812a-05c9419eaffe-2b21940c" class="satelites-header_text"><h1 class="heading-style-h3 is-hero">Where builders <!--$--><br><!--/$-->belong.</h1></div><div id="w-node-fb9e1c04-9ec6-abfa-812a-05c9419eb007-2b21940c" class="satelites-header_paragraph"><div class="paragraph-difference">Small teams own the hardest  problems. Every subsystem powers a mission that counts.</div><div class="paragraph-color">Small teams own the hardest  problems. Every subsystem powers  a mission that counts.</div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section_home-phrase"><div class="spacer-xxhuge"></div><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="home-phrase_component is-smaller"><h2 class="heading-style-h3">We believe in ownership: if you design it, you see it fly. Pride comes from real hardware, not slide decks. Our teams move fast with autonomy, balancing pace with integrity.</h2><a href="#" class="button w-button">Careers →</a></div></div></div></section><section class="section_timeline-header"><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="timeline_header"><div class="css-grid"><h2 id="w-node-a16e3922-293d-5e42-cc26-982f1448e6b4-2b21940c" class="heading-style-h3">Greenfield challenges await</h2><div id="w-node-_2f299188-54a9-10d0-aa37-c23b70b3de76-2b21940c">Every subsystem contributes to bigger missions, different orbits, and new science. Every design challenge is a doorway to the future.</div></div></div></div></div><div class="timeline_mask-top"></div></section><section class="section_timeline is-1"><img src="/assets-f/img/4ce7a5a91ec52a.webp" loading="lazy" data-w-id="65521136-94f7-759d-0ea5-5c36647961fd" sizes="100vw" alt="" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69333244a7b7aea22b21941a/69333244a7b7aea22b2194ef_planetas-today%2520copy%25201-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69333244a7b7aea22b21941a/69333244a7b7aea22b2194ef_planetas-today%2520copy%25201-p-800.webp 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69333244a7b7aea22b21941a/69333244a7b7aea22b2194ef_planetas-today%2520copy%25201-p-1080.webp 1080w, /assets-f/img/4ce7a5a91ec52a.webp 1537w" class="timeline_image-1"><div class="padding-global full-height"><div class="container-large"><div class="timeline_component"><div class="timeline_progress"><div class="timeline_line-fill"></div></div><div class="timeline_item"><div id="w-node-_65521136-94f7-759d-0ea5-5c36647961f0-2b21940c" class="timeline_left"><div class="timeline_title align-right"><div>Today</div></div><div class="timeline_dot is-mobile"></div></div><div id="w-node-_65521136-94f7-759d-0ea5-5c36647961f4-2b21940c" class="timeline_center"><div class="timeline_dot is-today"></div></div><div id="w-node-_65521136-94f7-759d-0ea5-5c36647961f6-2b21940c" class="timeline_right"><div class="faq_group"><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" class="faq_item w-dropdown"><div class="faq_question w-dropdown-toggle"><div>Power</div><img loading="lazy" src="/assets-f/img/6a4c8c98fffb39.svg" alt="" class="satelites_faq-icon"></div><nav class="faq_answer w-dropdown-list"><div class="faq_answer-block"><div>Deploying the largest solar arrays ever built, paired with high-voltage, radiation-resilient power systems engineered for extreme environments.</div><img src="/assets-f/img/c877c21333a0cf.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69333244a7b7aea22b21941a/69333244a7b7aea22b2194dd_power-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69333244a7b7aea22b21941a/69333244a7b7aea22b2194dd_power-p-800.webp 800w, /assets-f/img/c877c21333a0cf.webp 931w" alt="" class="cover-image"></div><div class="spacer-small"></div></nav></div><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" class="faq_item w-dropdown"><div class="faq_question w-dropdown-toggle"><div>Propulsion</div><img loading="lazy" src="/assets-f/img/6a4c8c98fffb39.svg" alt="" class="satelites_faq-icon"></div><nav class="faq_answer w-dropdown-list"><div class="faq_answer-block"><div>Flying the highest-power electric propulsion system ever put in orbit — a 4× leap over the current state of the art.</div><img src="/assets-f/img/9db3be46bebffe.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69333244a7b7aea22b21941a/6936aba059c6f07879f3ac77_today-propulsion-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69333244a7b7aea22b21941a/6936aba059c6f07879f3ac77_today-propulsion-p-800.webp 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69333244a7b7aea22b21941a/6936aba059c6f07879f3ac77_today-propulsion-p-1080.webp 1080w, /assets-f/img/9db3be46bebffe.webp 1200w" alt="" class="cover-image"></div><div class="spacer-small"></div></nav></div><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" class="faq_item w-dropdown"><div class="faq_question w-dropdown-toggle"><div>Autonomy</div><img loading="lazy" src="/assets-f/img/6a4c8c98fffb39.svg" alt="" class="satelites_faq-icon"></div><nav class="faq_answer w-dropdown-list"><div class="faq_answer-block"><div>Autonomy at constellation scale, with onboard radiation recovery, mission-data processing, and a full in-house autonomy stack written in Rust.</div><img src="/assets-f/img/8a57332deec756.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69333244a7b7aea22b21941a/69333244a7b7aea22b219539_today-autonomy-v2-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69333244a7b7aea22b21941a/69333244a7b7aea22b219539_today-autonomy-v2-p-800.webp 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69333244a7b7aea22b21941a/69333244a7b7aea22b219539_today-autonomy-v2-p-1080.webp 1080w, /assets-f/img/8a57332deec756.webp 1200w" alt="" class="cover-image"></div><div class="spacer-small"></div></nav></div><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" class="faq_item w-dropdown"><div class="faq_question w-dropdown-toggle"><div>Thermal</div><img loading="lazy" src="/assets-f/img/6a4c8c98fffb39.svg" alt="" class="satelites_faq-icon"></div><nav class="faq_answer w-dropdown-list"><div class="faq_answer-block"><div>Managing double-digit kilowatt systems with extreme heat flux, and designing thermal architectures that safely reject that heat across all Earth orbits and beyond.</div><img src="/assets-f/img/bc0c09b2b267ff.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69333244a7b7aea22b21941a/69333244a7b7aea22b2194dc_thermal-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69333244a7b7aea22b21941a/69333244a7b7aea22b2194dc_thermal-p-800.webp 800w, /assets-f/img/bc0c09b2b267ff.webp 931w" alt="" class="cover-image"></div><div class="spacer-small"></div></nav></div><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" class="faq_item w-dropdown"><div class="faq_question w-dropdown-toggle"><div>Pointing</div><img loading="lazy" src="/assets-f/img/6a4c8c98fffb39.svg" alt="" class="satelites_faq-icon"></div><nav class="faq_answer w-dropdown-list"><div class="faq_answer-block"><div>Developing ultra-stable pointing and attitude control for massive apertures — keeping momentum in check even with large deployables.</div><img src="/assets-f/img/3815a4e3e50645.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69333244a7b7aea22b21941a/69333244a7b7aea22b2194db_pointing-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69333244a7b7aea22b21941a/69333244a7b7aea22b2194db_pointing-p-800.webp 800w, /assets-f/img/3815a4e3e50645.webp 931w" alt="" class="cover-image"></div><div class="spacer-small"></div></nav></div><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" class="faq_item w-dropdown"><div class="faq_question w-dropdown-toggle"><div>Deployment</div><img loading="lazy" src="/assets-f/img/6a4c8c98fffb39.svg" alt="" class="satelites_faq-icon"></div><nav class="faq_answer w-dropdown-list"><div class="faq_answer-block"><div>Building in-house dispensing systems capable of deploying dozens of satellites per launch, engineered to survive the most punishing deployment dynamics.</div><img src="/assets-f/img/ac20b1da74ab32.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69333244a7b7aea22b21941a/69333244a7b7aea22b21951c_today-deployment-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69333244a7b7aea22b21941a/69333244a7b7aea22b21951c_today-deployment-p-800.webp 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69333244a7b7aea22b21941a/69333244a7b7aea22b21951c_today-deployment-p-1080.webp 1080w, /assets-f/img/ac20b1da74ab32.webp 1200w" alt="" class="cover-image"></div><div class="spacer-small"></div></nav></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69333244a7b7aea22b21941a/69333244a7b7aea22b21951a_planetas-today%20copy%201%20(1).webp" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 618px) 100vw, 618px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69333244a7b7aea22b21941a/69333244a7b7aea22b21951a_planetas-today%2520copy%25201%2520(1)-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69333244a7b7aea22b21941a/69333244a7b7aea22b21951a_planetas-today%20copy%201%20(1).webp 618w" alt="" class="timeline_planet-mobile"></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section_timeline is-2"><img src="/assets-f/img/873fdd8de9d4fe.webp" loading="lazy" data-w-id="f87acf1d-3db1-f4b5-668b-c35c369a8784" sizes="(max-width: 1626px) 100vw, 1626px" alt="" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69333244a7b7aea22b21941a/69333244a7b7aea22b2194f0_planetas-tomorrow%2520copy%25201-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69333244a7b7aea22b21941a/69333244a7b7aea22b2194f0_planetas-tomorrow%2520copy%25201-p-800.webp 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69333244a7b7aea22b21941a/69333244a7b7aea22b2194f0_planetas-tomorrow%2520copy%25201-p-1080.webp 1080w, /assets-f/img/873fdd8de9d4fe.webp 1626w" class="timeline_image-2"><div class="padding-global full-height"><div class="container-large full-height"><div class="timeline_component"><div class="timeline_progress"><div class="timeline_line-fill"></div></div><div class="timeline_item"><div id="w-node-f87acf1d-3db1-f4b5-668b-c35c369a8776-2b21940c" class="timeline_left"><div class="faq_group"><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" class="faq_item w-dropdown"><div class="faq_question w-dropdown-toggle"><div>Multi-Orbit Constellations</div><img loading="lazy" src="/assets-f/img/6a4c8c98fffb39.svg" alt="" class="satelites_faq-icon"></div><nav class="faq_answer w-dropdown-list"><div class="faq_answer-block"><div>Deploying integrated satellite networks that span LEO, MEO, GEO, and cislunar space — with dynamic load balancing and mission-specific routing across the orbital stack.</div><img src="/assets-f/img/731e455c8bed27.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69333244a7b7aea22b21941a/69333244a7b7aea22b2194ee_multi-orbit-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69333244a7b7aea22b21941a/69333244a7b7aea22b2194ee_multi-orbit-p-800.webp 800w, /assets-f/img/731e455c8bed27.webp 933w" alt="" class="cover-image"></div><div class="spacer-small"></div></nav></div><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" class="faq_item w-dropdown"><div class="faq_question w-dropdown-toggle"><div>Deep Space Relay</div><img loading="lazy" src="/assets-f/img/6a4c8c98fffb39.svg" alt="" class="satelites_faq-icon"></div><nav class="faq_answer w-dropdown-list"><div class="faq_answer-block"><div>Constructing autonomous relay networks in cislunar and interplanetary space to form a deep-space data backbone.</div><img src="/assets-f/img/e67e4b70804c29.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69333244a7b7aea22b21941a/69333244a7b7aea22b219517_Deep%2520space%2520relay-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69333244a7b7aea22b21941a/69333244a7b7aea22b219517_Deep%2520space%2520relay-p-800.webp 800w, /assets-f/img/e67e4b70804c29.webp 933w" alt="" class="cover-image"></div><div class="spacer-small"></div></nav></div><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" class="faq_item w-dropdown"><div class="faq_question w-dropdown-toggle"><div>Next Great Observatories</div><img loading="lazy" src="/assets-f/img/6a4c8c98fffb39.svg" alt="" class="satelites_faq-icon"></div><nav class="faq_answer w-dropdown-list"><div class="faq_answer-block"><div>Building high-power observatories from X-ray to far-infrared to detect cosmic events and hunt for exoplanets.</div><img src="/assets-f/img/1a2ab12a56972b.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69333244a7b7aea22b21941a/6939c3a2bff842679e670bcd_NGO-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69333244a7b7aea22b21941a/6939c3a2bff842679e670bcd_NGO-p-800.webp 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69333244a7b7aea22b21941a/6939c3a2bff842679e670bcd_NGO-p-1080.webp 1080w, /assets-f/img/1a2ab12a56972b.webp 1456w" alt="" class="cover-image"></div><div class="spacer-small"></div></nav></div><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" class="faq_item w-dropdown"><div class="faq_question w-dropdown-toggle"><div>Nuclear Electric Propulsion</div><img loading="lazy" src="/assets-f/img/6a4c8c98fffb39.svg" alt="" class="satelites_faq-icon"></div><nav class="faq_answer w-dropdown-list"><div class="faq_answer-block"><div>Developing heat pumps and massive radiators that solve the hardest thermal problems, enable Hall thrusters powered by nuclear systems, and redefine solar-system travel.</div><img sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69333244a7b7aea22b21941a/69333244a7b7aea22b2194ed_Nuclear%2520electric%2520propulsion-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69333244a7b7aea22b21941a/69333244a7b7aea22b2194ed_Nuclear%2520electric%2520propulsion-p-800.webp 800w, /assets-f/img/e8ae7c72a703cc.webp 936w" alt="" src="/assets-f/img/e8ae7c72a703cc.webp" loading="lazy" class="cover-image"></div><div class="spacer-small"></div></nav></div><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" class="faq_item w-dropdown"><div class="faq_question w-dropdown-toggle"><div>Deep Space Data Centers</div><img loading="lazy" src="/assets-f/img/6a4c8c98fffb39.svg" alt="" class="satelites_faq-icon"></div><nav class="faq_answer w-dropdown-list"><div class="faq_answer-block"><div>Designing high-power compute platforms that push processing to the deep-space edge — the most capable compute systems ever launched.</div><img sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69333244a7b7aea22b21941a/6939e0ec272d45ea27ab7a51_data%20center%20in%20space-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69333244a7b7aea22b21941a/6939e0ec272d45ea27ab7a51_data%20center%20in%20space-p-800.webp 800w, /assets-f/img/7757ba537580bc.webp 933w" alt="" src="/assets-f/img/7757ba537580bc.webp" loading="lazy" class="cover-image"></div><div class="spacer-small"></div></nav></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69333244a7b7aea22b21941a/69333244a7b7aea22b21951b_planetas-tomorrow%20copy%201.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69333244a7b7aea22b21941a/69333244a7b7aea22b21951b_planetas-tomorrow%2520copy%25201-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69333244a7b7aea22b21941a/69333244a7b7aea22b21951b_planetas-tomorrow%20copy%201.webp 678w" alt="" class="timeline_planet-mobile"></div><div id="w-node-f87acf1d-3db1-f4b5-668b-c35c369a877e-2b21940c" class="timeline_center"><div class="timeline_dot is-tomorrow"></div><div class="timeline_dot finish"></div></div><div id="w-node-f87acf1d-3db1-f4b5-668b-c35c369a8780-2b21940c" class="timeline_right tomorrow"><div class="timeline_title align-left"><div>Tomorrow</div></div><div class="timeline_dot is-mobile-tomorrow"></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section_timeline is-3"><div class="timeline_dot finish-mask"></div><div class="padding-global full-height"><div class="container-large full-height"><div class="timeline_block"><h2 data-w-id="56328fd2-c9f5-2c50-6ace-178d805f68d8" class="timeline-heading">Beyond</h2><div data-w-id="d98198f8-7e25-b506-d24d-766a3d5cadca" class="timeline_paragraph"><div>What Comes After the Frontier?</div><div class="text-color-secondary">The work you do today unlocks tomorrow’s orbits. From lunar data hubs to Webb-scale science at a fraction of cost. We build the hardware that flies the future.</div></div></div></div></div><div data-w-id="c950bd73-5b94-698f-75d2-d1e8855abdb7" class="about-satelites_component"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69333244a7b7aea22b21941a/69333244a7b7aea22b21950f_image%20(33).webp" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69333244a7b7aea22b21941a/69333244a7b7aea22b21950f_image%2520(33)-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69333244a7b7aea22b21941a/69333244a7b7aea22b21950f_image%2520(33)-p-800.webp 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69333244a7b7aea22b21941a/69333244a7b7aea22b21950f_image%2520(33)-p-1080.webp 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69333244a7b7aea22b21941a/69333244a7b7aea22b21950f_image%2520(33)-p-1600.webp 1600w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69333244a7b7aea22b21941a/69333244a7b7aea22b21950f_image%20(33).webp 1857w" alt="" class="about-satelites_bg"><div data-poster-url="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68f94692305c424b2500e672%2F692df88be463c97dabfa7c15_about-dyson-loop_poster.0000000.jpg" data-video-urls="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69333244a7b7aea22b21941a/69333244a7b7aea22b219516_about-dyson-loop_mp4.mp4,https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69333244a7b7aea22b21941a/69333244a7b7aea22b219516_about-dyson-loop_webm.webm" data-autoplay="true" data-loop="true" data-wf-ignore="true" data-w-id="cf5136b4-5019-10f0-fd0a-1a4f172a39be" class="about-satelites_video w-background-video w-background-video-atom"><video id="cf5136b4-5019-10f0-fd0a-1a4f172a39be-video" autoplay="" loop="" style="background-image:url(&quot;https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68f94692305c424b2500e672%2F692df88be463c97dabfa7c15_about-dyson-loop_poster.0000000.jpg&quot;)" muted="" playsinline="" data-wf-ignore="true" data-object-fit="cover"><source src="/assets-f/media/b4628d8c2c7d36.mp4" data-wf-ignore="true"><source src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69333244a7b7aea22b21941a/69333244a7b7aea22b219516_about-dyson-loop_webm.webm" data-wf-ignore="true"></video></div><div class="satelites_component-about is-1"><div class="satelites_block-about"><div style="opacity:0" class="satelites_corner"><img src="/assets-f/img/279a9d703cc82e.svg" loading="eager" alt="" class="corner home-1"><img src="/assets-f/img/e8f589ee9969e2.svg" loading="eager" alt="" class="corner home-2"><img src="/assets-f/img/ba1988d10b7011.svg" loading="eager" alt="" class="corner home-3"><img src="/assets-f/img/1e3fdb274c1092.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="corner home-4"></div><div class="satelites_info is-about"><div class="satelites_image"><div class="cl-satelite_wrapper w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="cl-satelite_list w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="cl-satelite_item w-dyn-item"><div class="satelites_image"><img src="/assets-f/img/49a6b62684655a.webp" loading="lazy" alt="" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69333244a7b7aea22b219421/69333244a7b7aea22b21952f_flagshipimage%2520(2)-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69333244a7b7aea22b219421/69333244a7b7aea22b21952f_flagshipimage%2520(2)-p-800.webp 800w, /assets-f/img/49a6b62684655a.webp 842w" class="satelites_image-cover hide-tablet"><div class="satelites_content-image"><h3 class="heading-style-h4">Flagship Science and Exploration</h3><div>Enabling frequent, complex missions to search for life and explore the outer solar system.</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="satelites_hover-close"></div></div></div><div class="satelites_component-about is-2"><div class="satelites_block-about"><div style="opacity:0" class="satelites_corner"><img src="/assets-f/img/279a9d703cc82e.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="corner home-1"><img src="/assets-f/img/e8f589ee9969e2.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="corner home-2"><img src="/assets-f/img/ba1988d10b7011.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="corner home-3"><img src="/assets-f/img/1e3fdb274c1092.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="corner home-4"></div><div class="satelites_info is-about"><div class="satelites_image"><div class="cl-satelite_wrapper w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="cl-satelite_list w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="cl-satelite_item w-dyn-item"><img src="/assets-f/img/6084bbf5b33021.webp" loading="lazy" alt="" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69333244a7b7aea22b219421/6939df49f9d6ace73ebb38fb_Telescope%20Array-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69333244a7b7aea22b219421/6939df49f9d6ace73ebb38fb_Telescope%20Array-p-800.webp 800w, /assets-f/img/6084bbf5b33021.webp 1024w" class="satelites_image-cover hide-tablet"><div class="satelites_content-image"><h3 class="heading-style-h4">Telescopes</h3><div>Assembling giant telescopes and telescope arrays to characterize exoplanet surfaces in unprecedented detail.</div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="satelites_hover-close"></div></div></div><div class="satelites_component-about is-3"><div class="satelites_block-about"><div style="opacity:0" class="satelites_corner"><img src="/assets-f/img/279a9d703cc82e.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="corner home-1"><img src="/assets-f/img/e8f589ee9969e2.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="corner home-2"><img src="/assets-f/img/ba1988d10b7011.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="corner home-3"><img src="/assets-f/img/1e3fdb274c1092.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="corner home-4"></div><div class="satelites_info is-about"><div class="satelites_image"><div class="cl-satelite_wrapper w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="cl-satelite_list w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="cl-satelite_item w-dyn-item"><img src="/assets-f/img/8d8c08862f6824.webp" loading="lazy" alt="" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69333244a7b